    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "RTC Packet Loss (Latest Reading)",
      "description": "Per-app packet loss for real-time media traffic. SOURCE: fortigate_rtc_sla_packetloss, label app. IMPORTANT: fortinet.firewall.packetloss is mapped as a keyword (string) field in this Elasticsearch index, not numeric \u2014 confirmed via _mapping/field lookup on 2026-08-25. Elasticsearch stats aggregations are not supported on keyword fields, so unlike latency/jitter above, this value is the single LATEST reading in each 30s poll window, not a true window average. Thresholds: Green <1%, Yellow 1-5%, Red >5%.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "P4169E866C3094E38"
